<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyzstan H1 industry output rises 28.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyzstan H1 industry output rises 28.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's industrial production grew by 28.8 percent year on year in January-June, the National Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZSTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan-June'97   Jan-June'96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +28.8	  +13.2</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
